### Trip planner Tests
GET http://localhost:7072/api/TripPlanning

###

### create trip
POST http://localhost:7072/api/TripPlanning/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sunny Beach Trip",
  "startTrip": "2025-11-10T09:00:00",
  "endTrip": "2025-11-15T18:00:00",
  "latitude": 56.12345,
  "longitude": 12.54321,
  "price": 499.99,
  "category": "BEACH",
  "guideId": 1
}

###

### Get all trips (no filter)
GET http://localhost:7072/api/TripPlanning/trips

###

### Get trips filtered by category
GET http://localhost:7072/api/TripPlanning/trips?category=BEACH

###

### Get trip by id
GET http://localhost:7072/api/TripPlanning/trips/1

###

### delete trip by id
DELETE http://localhost:7072/api/TripPlanning/trips/2

###

### get after delete by id
GET http://localhost:7072/api/TripPlanning/trips/2
###

### Update trip by ID
PUT http://localhost:7072/api/TripPlanning/trips/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "test",
  "startTrip": "2025-11-10T09:00:00",
  "endTrip": "2025-11-15T18:00:00",
  "latitude": 56.12345,
  "longitude": 12.54321,
  "price": 499.99,
  "category": "BEACH",
  "guideId": 1
}

