#### guid test ####

### create a guide
POST http://localhost:7072/api/TripPlanning/guides
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mariam Elmir",
  "email": "mariam@example.com",
  "phone": "0402771",
  "yearsOfExperience": 5
}

###

### Get all guides
GET http://localhost:7072/api/TripPlanning/guides

###

### get by id
GET http://localhost:7072/api/TripPlanning/guides/1

###

### delete guide by id
DELETE http://localhost:7072/api/TripPlanning/guides/2

###

###Get guide by id (after deletion)
GET http://localhost:7072/api/TripPlanning/guides/2

###

###Update guide by ID
PUT http://localhost:7072/api/TripPlanning/guides/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Anna K. Jensen",
  "email": "anna.kj@example.com",
  "phone": "12345678",
  "yearsOfExperience": 6
}

###

###Get trips for guide
GET http://localhost:7072/api/TripPlanning/guides/1/trips

